*HEADING
Project 05 V3b: uniform temperature rise 20 -> 22 degC, FULL edge faces restrained in-plane (ideal restraint), uz on the mid-line, linear
** SI units (m, kg, s, N, Pa), temperatures in degC
*INCLUDE, INPUT=../../mesh/v_n40_z2.inp
*NSET, NSET=FRAME_ALL
FRAME_X0, FRAME_X1, FRAME_Y0, FRAME_Y1
*MATERIAL, NAME=TI64
*ELASTIC
113.8E9, 0.33
*EXPANSION, ZERO=20.
8.6E-6
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=PANEL, MATERIAL=TI64
